@@ -204,3 +204,22 @@ continuous recourse:
 
 They require separate VURP-M coefficient, state, and validation layers. The
 current performance suite is exact without them.
+
+
+## P0 OA hotfix after Example9_1
+
+Fractional-node SOC outer approximation is now budgeted rather than closed to
+full convergence at every branch-and-bound node. Root nodes use
+`ROOT_OA_ROUND_LIMIT` rounds (default 6), non-root nodes use
+`NODE_OA_ROUND_LIMIT` rounds (default 1), and each round adds at most
+`MAX_OA_CUTS_PER_ROUND` tangents (default 24). Node tangents are inherited only
+along the current branch; only initial and certified-SOCP tangents are shared
+across sibling nodes. This preserves exactness because all fractional masters
+remain valid relaxations and every integer partition is certified by the exact
+SOCP oracle.
+
+Fixed sortie counts are processed starting from the certified incumbent's
+sortie count, then neighbouring counts, unless
+`PRIORITIZE_INCUMBENT_SORTIE_COUNT false` or `--ascending-sortie-order` is used.
+The initial heuristic also reserves at least one SOCP candidate for each sortie
+count before using the remaining candidate budget.
